-    -   `minVertex`: Bounding box minimum (`ATTR_3F`).
-    -   `maxVertex`: Bounding box maximum (`ATTR_3F`).
-    -   `volumeSize`: Resolution vector (`ATTR_3I`).
-    -   `volumeMipmapLevel`: Target mip level (`ATTR_1I`).
